    # gateway, request-file and HTTP-only targets have no HTTP operation to emit (an executable
    # resource or a command is an rpc operation), the vertical targets need their own import's
    # extras, and the remaining cells lose the device-model extras (access modes, units, attribute
    # codes) or the canonical scalar spellings (`double`, `uint16`) the shared emitters cannot spell.
